{
  "id": "contract:qa-specification",
  "version": "1.0.4",
  "format": "JSON_SCHEMA",
  "instructions": [
    "Retorne somente uma QASpecification aderente ao JSON Schema.",
    "Cubra integralmente todos os IDs AC, BR, DEC e DOD em cenários, mapas de cobertura e matriz de rastreabilidade. Para CADA id de productOwnerSpecification.acceptanceCriteria[] e CADA id de productOwnerSpecification.businessRules[], faça uma auditoria por sourceId: ao menos um cenário MUST conter o id em functionalReferences; traceability.functionalCoverage MUST conter exatamente uma entrada com esse sourceId e scenarioIds não vazio, cujos cenários MUST conter o mesmo id; e ao menos uma linha de traceability.matrix MUST conter o id em functionalSourceIds e relacioná-lo a um cenário da mesma linha que contenha o id em functionalReferences. Para CADA id de technicalSpecification.decisions[] e CADA id de technicalSpecification.definitionOfDone[], faça a auditoria equivalente: ao menos um cenário MUST conter exatamente o id em technicalReferences; traceability.technicalCoverage MUST conter exatamente uma entrada com esse sourceId e scenarioIds não vazio, cujos cenários MUST conter o mesmo id; e ao menos uma linha de traceability.matrix MUST conter o id em technicalSourceIds e relacioná-lo a um cenário da mesma linha que contenha o id em technicalReferences. MUST NOT omitir, renomear, substituir ou inferir cobertura por contagem para nenhum ID AC, BR, DEC ou DOD. IF uma ocorrência obrigatória estiver ausente, THEN MUST criar ou corrigir a cobertura válida e repetir a auditoria antes do retorno.",
    "Antes de emitir o JSON, faça uma auditoria relacional par-a-par sem confiar em traceability.summary ou em contagens agregadas. Para CADA traceability.functionalCoverage[] e CADA scenarioId associado, o cenário existente correspondente MUST conter, por igualdade exata, o sourceId da entrada em functionalReferences. Para CADA traceability.technicalCoverage[] e CADA scenarioId associado, o cenário existente correspondente MUST conter, por igualdade exata, o sourceId da entrada em technicalReferences. Para CADA traceability.matrix[] e CADA scenarioId da linha, o cenário existente correspondente MUST compartilhar ao menos um par exato: functionalSourceIds com functionalReferences OR technicalSourceIds com technicalReferences. Se qualquer associação falhar, MUST corrigi-la e repetir a auditoria antes do retorno; MUST NOT usar totals, covered ou presença agregada de IDs como prova de consistência par-a-par.",
    "Derive traceability.summary somente depois dos detalhes e da rastreabilidade final. acceptanceCriteria.total, businessRules.total, technicalDecisions.total e definitionOfDone.total MUST ser, respectivamente, as quantidades de IDs únicos em productOwnerSpecification.acceptanceCriteria[], productOwnerSpecification.businessRules[], technicalSpecification.decisions[] e technicalSpecification.definitionOfDone[]. Para AC/BR, cada covered MUST contar somente IDs presentes simultaneamente em functionalReferences, functionalCoverage e functionalSourceIds da matrix. Para DEC/DOD, cada covered MUST contar somente IDs presentes simultaneamente em technicalReferences, technicalCoverage e technicalSourceIds da matrix. Como a cobertura integral é obrigatória, acceptanceCriteria.covered MUST ser EXATAMENTE igual a acceptanceCriteria.total; businessRules.covered MUST ser EXATAMENTE igual a businessRules.total; technicalDecisions.covered MUST ser EXATAMENTE igual a technicalDecisions.total; e definitionOfDone.covered MUST ser EXATAMENTE igual a definitionOfDone.total. Recalcule os oito valores por identidade imediatamente antes do JSON; MUST NOT declarar como coberto um ID ausente em qualquer superfície obrigatória e MUST NOT inferir cobertura por quantidade.",
    "Readiness é uma derivação obrigatória, não uma escolha. Depois de finalizar blockingItems, openQuestions e assumptions, aplique exatamente a primeira condição verdadeira: (1) IF productOwnerSpecification.readiness === \"REQUIRES_CLARIFICATION\" OR technicalSpecification.readiness === \"REQUIRES_CLARIFICATION\", THEN readiness MUST ser \"REQUIRES_CLARIFICATION\"; (2) ELSE IF blockingItems.length > 0, THEN readiness MUST ser \"REQUIRES_CLARIFICATION\"; (3) ELSE IF qualquer openQuestions[].impact === \"BLOCKING\", THEN readiness MUST ser \"REQUIRES_CLARIFICATION\"; (4) ELSE IF productOwnerSpecification.readiness === \"PARTIALLY_READY\" OR technicalSpecification.readiness === \"PARTIALLY_READY\", THEN readiness MUST ser \"PARTIALLY_READY\"; (5) ELSE IF openQuestions.length > 0 OR qualquer assumptions[].requiresValidation === true, THEN readiness MUST ser \"PARTIALLY_READY\"; (6) ELSE readiness MUST ser \"READY\". Uma assumption com requiresValidation === false, isoladamente, MUST NOT reduzir readiness. Antes de emitir o JSON, derive novamente e confirme igualdade exata com o campo readiness; readiness MUST NOT representar aprovação ou execução de testes.",
    "Não inclua código, Playwright, evidência de execução, artifacts ou propriedades adicionais."
  ],
  "schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": [
      "readiness",
      "title",
      "summary",
      "objective",
      "testStrategy",
      "traceability",
      "positiveScenarios",
      "negativeScenarios",
      "edgeCases",
      "risks",
      "approvalCriteria",
      "blockingItems",
      "priorityTests",
      "automationRecommendations",
      "assumptions",
      "openQuestions",
      "outOfScope"
    ],
    "properties": {
      "readiness": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["READY", "PARTIALLY_READY", "REQUIRES_CLARIFICATION"]
      },
      "title": { "$ref": "#/$defs/title" },
      "summary": { "$ref": "#/$defs/description" },
      "objective": { "$ref": "#/$defs/description" },
      "testStrategy": { "$ref": "#/$defs/testStrategy" },
      "traceability": { "$ref": "#/$defs/traceability" },
      "positiveScenarios": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 60,
        "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/positiveScenario" }
      },
      "negativeScenarios": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 60,
        "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/negativeScenario" }
      },
      "edgeCases": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 60, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/edgeCase" } },
      "risks": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 40, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/risk" } },
      "approvalCriteria": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 40,
        "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/approvalCriterion" }
      },
      "blockingItems": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 30,
        "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/blockingItem" }
      },
      "priorityTests": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 180,
        "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/priorityTest" }
      },
      "automationRecommendations": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 60,
        "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/automationRecommendation" }
      },
      "assumptions": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 30, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/assumption" } },
      "openQuestions": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 30,
        "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/openQuestion" }
      },
      "outOfScope": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 30,
        "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/outOfScopeItem" }
      }
    },
    "$defs": {
      "title": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1,
        "maxLength": 160,
        "pattern": "^\\S(?:[\\s\\S]*\\S)?$"
      },
      "description": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1,
        "maxLength": 2000,
        "pattern": "^\\S(?:[\\s\\S]*\\S)?$"
      },
      "item": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1,
        "maxLength": 1000,
        "pattern": "^\\S(?:[\\s\\S]*\\S)?$"
      },
      "itemList": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 50, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/item" } },
      "priority": { "type": "string", "enum": ["LOW", "MEDIUM", "HIGH", "CRITICAL"] },
      "testType": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "UNIT",
          "INTEGRATION",
          "CONTRACT",
          "API",
          "END_TO_END",
          "SECURITY",
          "PERFORMANCE",
          "ACCESSIBILITY",
          "USABILITY",
          "REGRESSION",
          "MANUAL",
          "OTHER"
        ]
      },
      "scenarioId": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^QA(?:P|N|E)-[0-9]{3}$" },
      "functionalId": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^(?:AC|BR)-[0-9]{3}$" },
      "technicalId": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^(?:CMP|MOD|FLW|CTR|API|EVT|ENT|REL|DEC|DOD)-[0-9]{3}$"
      },
      "sourceId": {
        "anyOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/functionalId" }, { "$ref": "#/$defs/technicalId" }]
      },
      "scenarioIds": {
        "type": "array",
        "minItems": 1,
        "maxItems": 200,
        "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/scenarioId" }
      },
      "testStrategy": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "approach",
          "objectives",
          "scope",
          "outOfScope",
          "testTypes",
          "environments",
          "preconditions",
          "testDataGuidelines",
          "entryCriteria",
          "exitCriteria"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "approach": { "$ref": "#/$defs/description" },
          "objectives": { "$ref": "#/$defs/itemList" },
          "scope": { "$ref": "#/$defs/itemList" },
          "outOfScope": { "$ref": "#/$defs/itemList" },
          "testTypes": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 12, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/testType" } },
          "environments": { "$ref": "#/$defs/itemList" },
          "preconditions": { "$ref": "#/$defs/itemList" },
          "testDataGuidelines": { "$ref": "#/$defs/itemList" },
          "entryCriteria": { "$ref": "#/$defs/itemList" },
          "exitCriteria": { "$ref": "#/$defs/itemList" }
        }
      },
      "scenarioBase": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "id",
          "title",
          "objective",
          "priority",
          "testTypes",
          "preconditions",
          "testData",
          "steps",
          "expectedResults",
          "functionalReferences",
          "technicalReferences",
          "automationSuitability",
          "rationale"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "$ref": "#/$defs/scenarioId" },
          "title": { "$ref": "#/$defs/title" },
          "objective": { "$ref": "#/$defs/description" },
          "priority": { "$ref": "#/$defs/priority" },
          "testTypes": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 12,
            "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/testType" }
          },
          "preconditions": { "$ref": "#/$defs/itemList" },
          "testData": { "$ref": "#/$defs/itemList" },
          "steps": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 30,
            "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/item" }
          },
          "expectedResults": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 30,
            "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/item" }
          },
          "functionalReferences": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 200,
            "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/functionalId" }
          },
          "technicalReferences": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 200,
            "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/technicalId" }
          },
          "automationSuitability": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["RECOMMENDED", "OPTIONAL", "NOT_RECOMMENDED"]
          },
          "rationale": { "$ref": "#/$defs/description" }
        }
      },
      "positiveScenario": { "$ref": "#/$defs/scenarioBase" },
      "negativeScenario": { "$ref": "#/$defs/scenarioBase" },
      "edgeCase": { "$ref": "#/$defs/scenarioBase" },
      "coverageSummaryItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["total", "covered"],
        "properties": {
          "total": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 200 },
          "covered": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 200 }
        }
      },
      "coverageSummary": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "acceptanceCriteria",
          "businessRules",
          "technicalDecisions",
          "definitionOfDone"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "acceptanceCriteria": { "$ref": "#/$defs/coverageSummaryItem" },
          "businessRules": { "$ref": "#/$defs/coverageSummaryItem" },
          "technicalDecisions": { "$ref": "#/$defs/coverageSummaryItem" },
          "definitionOfDone": { "$ref": "#/$defs/coverageSummaryItem" }
        }
      },
      "functionalCoverageItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["sourceId", "scenarioIds"],
        "properties": {
          "sourceId": { "$ref": "#/$defs/functionalId" },
          "scenarioIds": { "$ref": "#/$defs/scenarioIds" }
        }
      },
      "technicalCoverageItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["sourceId", "scenarioIds"],
        "properties": {
          "sourceId": { "$ref": "#/$defs/technicalId" },
          "scenarioIds": { "$ref": "#/$defs/scenarioIds" }
        }
      },
      "traceabilityRow": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["id", "functionalSourceIds", "technicalSourceIds", "scenarioIds"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^QTR-[0-9]{3}$" },
          "functionalSourceIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 200,
            "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/functionalId" }
          },
          "technicalSourceIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 200,
            "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/technicalId" }
          },
          "scenarioIds": { "$ref": "#/$defs/scenarioIds" }
        }
      },
      "traceability": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["summary", "functionalCoverage", "technicalCoverage", "matrix"],
        "properties": {
          "summary": { "$ref": "#/$defs/coverageSummary" },
          "functionalCoverage": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 200,
            "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/functionalCoverageItem" }
          },
          "technicalCoverage": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 200,
            "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/technicalCoverageItem" }
          },
          "matrix": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 200,
            "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/traceabilityRow" }
          }
        }
      },
      "risk": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["id", "description", "impact", "likelihood", "mitigation", "scenarioIds"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^QRISK-[0-9]{3}$" },
          "description": { "$ref": "#/$defs/description" },
          "impact": { "$ref": "#/$defs/priority" },
          "likelihood": { "type": "string", "enum": ["LOW", "MEDIUM", "HIGH"] },
          "mitigation": { "anyOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/description" }, { "type": "null" }] },
          "scenarioIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 200,
            "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/scenarioId" }
          }
        }
      },
      "approvalCriterion": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["id", "criterion", "scenarioIds"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^QAPR-[0-9]{3}$" },
          "criterion": { "$ref": "#/$defs/item" },
          "scenarioIds": { "$ref": "#/$defs/scenarioIds" }
        }
      },
      "blockingItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["id", "description", "sourceIds", "resolution"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^QBLK-[0-9]{3}$" },
          "description": { "$ref": "#/$defs/description" },
          "sourceIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 200,
            "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/sourceId" }
          },
          "resolution": { "$ref": "#/$defs/description" }
        }
      },
      "priorityTest": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["id", "rank", "scenarioId", "rationale"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^QPT-[0-9]{3}$" },
          "rank": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 180 },
          "scenarioId": { "$ref": "#/$defs/scenarioId" },
          "rationale": { "$ref": "#/$defs/description" }
        }
      },
      "automationRecommendation": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["id", "scenarioIds", "target", "priority", "rationale", "prerequisites"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^QAUT-[0-9]{3}$" },
          "scenarioIds": { "$ref": "#/$defs/scenarioIds" },
          "target": { "$ref": "#/$defs/testType" },
          "priority": { "$ref": "#/$defs/priority" },
          "rationale": { "$ref": "#/$defs/description" },
          "prerequisites": { "$ref": "#/$defs/itemList" }
        }
      },
      "assumption": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["id", "description", "requiresValidation"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^QASM-[0-9]{3}$" },
          "description": { "$ref": "#/$defs/description" },
          "requiresValidation": { "type": "boolean" }
        }
      },
      "openQuestion": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["id", "question", "impact"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^QQ-[0-9]{3}$" },
          "question": { "$ref": "#/$defs/description" },
          "impact": { "type": "string", "enum": ["BLOCKING", "NON_BLOCKING"] }
        }
      },
      "outOfScopeItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["id", "description"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^QOOS-[0-9]{3}$" },
          "description": { "$ref": "#/$defs/description" }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
